<h1>Complete call flows built with VoiceML.</h1>
<p class="lede">Each example is a working phone system for a fictional company, built from documents published on voiceml.org with no application server, and each shows a different capability. Every walkthrough includes the full markup, the order to publish it in, and the limits of the design. They are listed from the simplest to the most involved.</p>
